e things that  um we really promote here at ludwig plus  is a very strong culture  a very assured sense  of values a way of working  that makes us  be able to deliver the value for our  clients  and create an environment where people  can really become their full selves and  i think  um you know i i don't think it's just a  female thing  but we certainly are wired differently  and um i think it definitely plays a  very strong role in  in what uh we're creating here for sure  so for the  women i guess especially out there  watching who might be doubting  themselves who feel like i can't have it  all uh it's not possible to be an  entrepreneur and have  kids let alone eight kids and everything  you're doing if they're in a moment of  doubt  and feeling like it's not possible don't  support it and it's just not gonna  happen and they had to  fast forward this video to get to this  point just as a reminder to themselves  to stay strong and and that is possible  what would your message to them be  you know look we all have moments of  confidence you know you question your  confidence you question  the next move can i do this and i don't  care if you're a man or a woman  um i know i experienced it when i first  became  chief marketing officer of mccann which  is one of the top  agencies on the planet and i called a  very dear friend a man  a man who's a mentor of mine and i said  oh my god i'm gonna be  the cmo of this big you know ad agency  that i  always admired and it was um you know  definitely an awesome you know  experience and an  awesome responsibility and um  and he said what are you talking about  he goes every day you wake up you're  going to look in the mirror  and have these moments and you just  you've been doing it so just keep doing  it and take one step at a time  and i don't care if it's your profession  or your personal life you're going to  face  moments in life because life throws you  curveballs right so whether you're  building a business  or you're being thrown a curveball i  always  say take one step at a time  because you will always win you will get  to  the finish line you will get to that  goal whatever that goal is  one step at a time and i think that's  where you build confidence because  don't make it so grand to achieve and  that's why  back to your very beginning question of  how do you unearth the soul of the brand  how do you help an entrepreneur who has  this very big  aspiration how did they get there will  you brainstorm what are all the things i  need to do to get there and then what  did i tell you you do next  what can i do today to get there  and then tomorrow morning what's another  thing i can do  and just be action oriented we have a  saying here at the agency  gsd get done now right  it's not about not being thoughtful but  it's about  taking action don't wait to do something  go get it done if you can do it in five  minutes do it right now  because you might forget to do it and  then it's too late  and life is too short and your goals are  too big  so just start taking steps  right it's just like you know i say to  other mothers when you had a baby  it didn't come with an instruction  manual  right nobody said here's your  instruction manual to  change the diaper or be a mom or nurse  that baby or feed the baby  there's no instruction manual to be an  entrepreneur  yes you can read a lot of books and you  can get a lot of advice but at the end  of the day  take a step forward hat be action  oriented  gsdn right get done now  i love it barbara yola's in the house  every party it's amazing  somebody asked on the chat how many  women in our company  70 of our company's women and how  how big how many people are in the  company just about to hit 50.  i love it i love it all right for people  watching  on youtube uh who want to learn more  about you dive more into your world the  book's not out yet but where do you want  them to go is it instagram  twitter youtube your website where do  yo